<title>HUNGARY: Fotex group IAS Q1 97 net income 163 mln.</title>
<headline>Fotex group IAS Q1 97 net income 163 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-March 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	  247	  vs     80</p>
<p>Group profit before tax</p>
<p>	and minorities		  250	  vs     67</p>
<p>    Group sales		     8,056	  vs  7,098</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales	  5,601	  vs  4,813</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   2,455	  vs   2,285</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>	admin expenses	     2,208	  vs   2,205</p>
<p>    Net other income		   8 loss   vs	 0</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    11 profit vs	13 loss</p>
<p>    Taxation			    81	  vs	16</p>
<p>    Minorities			   6 loss   vs	20 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Fotex is a group of diversified retail activities.</p>
<p>The figures were consolidated, unaudited and were calculated in accordance with International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
